# Build context excludes — keep the image small and safe.

# Node / pnpm
**/node_modules
.pnpm-store
.pnpm-debug.log*

# Build outputs
**/dist
**/build
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/.cache

# Local env — NEVER bake into an image. The container receives configuration
# through compose env_file layering (docker/env/README.md), not a baked file.
.env
.env.*

# VCS / IDE
.git
.gitignore
.vscode
.idea
**/.DS_Store

# Logs / runtime
**/*.log
**/npm-debug.log*

# Tests and planning docs not needed in an image
**/__tests__
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
**/*.spec.ts
docs
openspec
.claude

# Docker and compose themselves
**/Dockerfile*
docker-compose*.yml

# NOTE: packs/ is deliberately NOT excluded. Authored pack content is the
# application's data (docs/SPEC.md §5); the api reads it and the pack sync job
# publishes it to object storage.
